  m_Text: Just arrived in Poppy Town today. I met some friendly people, including
    Polina and Mayor Belzy (such a funny name!). I do wonder why Polina was waiting
    at the station, as I never sent word ahead. Everyone here seems most welcoming.
    I do hope to speak with you soon, Mary.
